'''D'arktanyan''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and can be unlocked when rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] and [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] events. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added into the [[Cat Guide]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was not obtainable. As of the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|March 15, 2024 Update Patch]], he was officially unlockable by rolling in the [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] banner.

