==Trivia==
*The Cat on Valiant D'arktanyan's head wearing a bandage on his right eye and having much more hair could possibly reference to Raiden from ''[[wikipedia:Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance|Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance]]''.
*From July 14, 2023 to August 3, 2023, D'arktanyan, along with [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]], was accidentally made available in the gacha system in The Battle Cats Unite despite not being properly added in Version 1.0.6. This was later fixed in Version 1.0.7 when they made this unit unavailable until a future update comes out to properly re-add it in.
**As of March 15, 2024, D'arktanyan was later readded as a playable unit.

